  <h2>Information can go out of date</h2>
  <p>
    Airports rearrange rental desks, companies change fees and terms, insurance
    products vary by supplier and rate, and roads and tolls change. We note this
    throughout the guides for a reason. Before you book, sign, or drive, confirm
    the specifics on <strong>your own quote, voucher, rental agreement, and the
    official airport or authority websites</strong>. Where a guide and your
    booking disagree, your booking is what counts.
  </p>

  <h2>Not professional advice</h2>
